#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The examples in this section illustrate some common ways to use the Executor primitive. Before running these examples, follow the instructions in [Install Qiskit](/guides/install-qiskit) and [Executor quickstart](/guides/directed-execution-model).\n"
msgstr "Ang mga halimbawa sa seksyong ito ay naglalarawan ng ilang karaniwang paraan ng paggamit ng Executor primitive. Bago patakbuhin ang mga halimbawang ito, sundin ang mga tagubilin sa [I-install ang Qiskit](/guides/install-qiskit) at [Executor quickstart](/guides/directed-execution-model).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Before you begin {#before-you-begin}"
msgstr "Bago ka magsimula {#before-you-begin}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Some of the code examples on this page use `samplex`, which is part of the Samplomatic package.  Therefore, before running those code block, you must install Samplomatic, as shown in the following code block.  For more information, see the [Samplomatic documentation](https://qiskit.github.io/samplomatic).\n"
msgstr "Ang ilang mga halimbawa ng code sa pahinang ito ay gumagamit ng `samplex`, na bahagi ng Samplomatic package. Samakatuwid, bago patakbuhin ang mga code block na iyon, kailangan mong i-install ang Samplomatic, tulad ng ipinapakita sa sumusunod na code block. Para sa karagdagang impormasyon, tingnan ang [dokumentasyon ng Samplomatic](https://qiskit.github.io/samplomatic).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Parameterized circuit {#example-parameterized-circuit}"
msgstr "Halimbawa: Parameterized circuit {#example-parameterized-circuit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This example illustrates how to add circuit items with parameters, as well as how to add samplex items. It consists of these steps:\n"
"1. Set up the circuit: Generate and transpile the target circuit.\n"
"2. Prepare a samplex: Group gates and measurements into annotated boxes and generate the circuit template and samplex pair.\n"
"3. Execute: Add a circuit item and a samplex item to a `QuantumProgram` and execute both in a single job.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ipinapakita ng halimbawang ito kung paano magdagdag ng mga circuit item na may mga parameter, pati na rin kung paano magdagdag ng mga samplex item. Binubuo ito ng mga hakbang na ito:\n"
"1. I-set up ang circuit: Bumuo at mag-transpile ng target circuit.\n"
"2. Ihanda ang samplex: I-grupo ang mga gate at sukat sa mga annotated box at bumuo ng pares ng circuit template at samplex.\n"
"3. Isabuhay: Magdagdag ng circuit item at samplex item sa isang `QuantumProgram` at sabay na patakbuhin ang dalawa sa isang trabaho.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up the circuit {#set-up-the-circuit}"
msgstr "I-set up ang circuit {#set-up-the-circuit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare a three-qubit GHZ state, rotate the qubits around the Pauli-Z axis, and measures the qubits in the computational basis.\n"
msgstr "Maghanda ng 3-qubit GHZ state, i-rotate ang mga qubit sa paligid ng Pauli-Z axis, at sukatin ang mga qubit sa computational basis.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Specify the backend and transpile the circuit to only use instructions supported by the QPU (referred to as an instruction set architecture (ISA) circuit).\n"
msgstr "Tukuyin ang backend at i-transpile ang circuit upang gumamit lamang ng mga tagubilin na sinusuportahan ng QPU (tinutukoy bilang isang instruction set architecture (ISA) circuit).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare the samplex {#prepare-the-samplex}"
msgstr "Ihanda ang samplex {#prepare-the-samplex}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the `generate_boxing_pass_manager` convenience function and its twirling parameters to group two-qubit gates and measurements into boxes and apply twirling annotations.\n"
msgstr "Gamitin ang convenience function na `generate_boxing_pass_manager` at ang mga twirling parameter nito upang i-grupo ang mga two-qubit gate at sukat sa mga box at mag-apply ng mga twirling annotation.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the `build` method to generate the template circuit and the samplex.\n"
msgstr "Gamitin ang pamamaraan ng `build` upang bumuo ng template circuit at samplex.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Execute the circuits {#execute-the-circuits}"
msgstr "Isabuhay ang mga circuit {#execute-the-circuits}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Executor runs `QuantumProgram` objects. Each `QuantumProgram` can contain several items. This example adds a circuit item and a samplex item for execution. For full details, see [Executor input and output](/guides/executor-input-output).\n"
msgstr "Ang Executor ay nagpapatakbo ng mga bagay na `QuantumProgram`. Ang bawat `QuantumProgram` ay maaaring maglaman ng ilang mga item. Ang halimbawang ito ay nagdadagdag ng circuit item at samplex item para sa pagpapatakbo. Para sa buong detalye, tingnan ang [Executor input and output](/guides/executor-input-output).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The first step is to initialize an empty program, requesting `1024` shots for each configuration of each item.\n"
msgstr "Ang unang hakbang ay ang mag-initialize ng walang laman na programa, na humihiling ng `1024` shots para sa bawat configuration ng bawat item.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Append the circuit item to the `QuantumProgram`. This circuit item consists of two parts - the ISA circuit and 10 sets of its parameter values.\n"
msgstr "I-append ang circuit item sa `QuantumProgram`. Ang circuit item na ito ay binubuo ng dalawang bahagi - ang ISA circuit at 10 set ng mga halaga ng parameter nito.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Append the samplex item to the `QuantumProgram` with these arguments:\n"
"- The template circuit and the samplex generated by the `build` function\n"
"- Ten sets of parameter values for the original circuit\n"
"- The number of randomizations to perform\n"
msgstr ""
"I-append ang samplex item sa `QuantumProgram` gamit ang mga argumentong ito:\n"
"- Ang template circuit at samplex na nabuo ng function na `build`\n"
"- Sampung set ng mga halaga ng parameter para sa orihinal na circuit\n"
"- Ang bilang ng mga randomization na isasagawa\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run the Executor job {#run-the-executor-job}"
msgstr "Patakbuhin ang Executor job {#run-the-executor-job}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Retrieve the result for each task.\n"
msgstr "Kunin ang resulta para sa bawat task.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Perform PEC {#example-perform-pec}"
msgstr "Halimbawa: Magsagawa ng PEC {#example-perform-pec}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This example shows how to use a samplex item to perform probabilistic error cancellation ([PEC](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#pec)) for error mitigation.\n"
msgstr "Ipinapakita ng halimbawang ito kung paano gumamit ng samplex item upang magsagawa ng probabilistic error cancellation ([PEC](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#pec)) para sa error mitigation.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Consider a mirrored-version of a circuit with ten qubits and two unique layers of CX gates. These are the main tasks:\n"
"- Execute the circuit with twirling.\n"
"- Execute the circuit with PEC mitigation, as in the paper [\"Probabilistic error cancellation with sparse Pauli-Lindblad models on noisy quantum processors\"](https://arxiv.org/abs/2201.09866).\n"
msgstr ""
"Isaalang-alang ang isang mirror na bersyon ng isang circuit na may sampung qubit at dalawang natatanging layer ng mga CX gate. Narito ang mga pangunahing gawain:\n"
"- Isakatuparan ang circuit gamit ang twirling.\n"
"- Isakatuparan ang circuit gamit ang PEC mitigation, tulad ng sa papel [\"Probabilistic error cancellation with sparse Pauli-Lindblad models on noisy quantum processors\"](https://arxiv.org/abs/2201.09866).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The pipeline consists of these steps:\n"
"1. Set up: Generate the target circuit and group its operations into boxes.\n"
"2. Learn: Learn the noise of the instructions that we want to mitigate with PEC.\n"
"3. Execute: Run the circuit on a backend.\n"
"4. Analyze: Post-process and analyze the results.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang pipeline ay binubuo ng mga hakbang na ito:\n"
"1. I-set up: Bumuo ng target circuit at i-grupo ang mga operasyon nito sa mga box.\n"
"2. Matuto: Matutunan ang noise ng mga tagubilin na nais naming i-mitigate gamit ang PEC.\n"
"3. Isabuhay: Patakbuhin ang circuit sa isang backend.\n"
"4. Suriin: I-post-process at suriin ang mga resulta.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For comparison, we will run this mirrored circuit twice. Once with only Pauli-twirling applied, and once withe PEC mitigation applied.\n"
msgstr "Para sa paghahambing, patatakbuhin namin ang mirrored circuit na ito nang dalawang beses. Minsan na may Pauli-twirling lamang na inilapat, at minsan na may PEC mitigation na inilapat.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"The usage for this example is approximately 10 minutes on a Heron r2 processor.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Ang paggamit para sa halimbawang ito ay humigit-kumulang 10 minuto sa isang Heron r2 processor.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up the circuit {#set-up-the-circuit-1}"
msgstr "I-set up ang circuit {#set-up-the-circuit-1}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Choose a backend and prepare a 10-qubit circuit.\n"
msgstr "Pumili ng backend at maghanda ng 10-qubit circuit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/executor-examples/extracted-outputs/f9e93b2c-154a-4d09-872d-f770bcc669c4-0.svg)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/executor-examples/extracted-outputs/f9e93b2c-154a-4d09-872d-f770bcc669c4-0.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Combine the circuit with its inverse to create a mirror circuit.\n"
msgstr "Pagsamahin ang circuit at ang inverse nito upang lumikha ng mirror circuit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/executor-examples/extracted-outputs/f8ac3f75-88ca-40f9-8382-6a427303bb8e-0.svg)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/executor-examples/extracted-outputs/f8ac3f75-88ca-40f9-8382-6a427303bb8e-0.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set some parameter values:\n"
msgstr "Magtakda ng ilang mga halaga ng parameter:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the pass manager to transpile the circuit to become an ISA circuit.\n"
msgstr "Gamitin ang pass manager upang i-transpile ang circuit upang maging ISA circuit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, group gates and measurements into annotated boxes. You can do this manually or use the `generate_boxing_pass_manager` function from Samplomatic for convenience. The first circuit will only have twirling applied and therefore only needs the `Twirl` annotation. The second circuit will be run with full PEC mitigation and needs both `Twirl` and `InjectNoise` annotations.\n"
msgstr "Susunod, i-grupo ang mga gate at sukat sa mga annotated box. Maaari mo itong gawin nang manu-mano o gamitin ang function na `generate_boxing_pass_manager` mula sa Samplomatic para sa kaginhawahan. Ang unang circuit ay magkakaroon lamang ng twirling na inilapat kaya nangangailangan lamang ng annotation na `Twirl`. Ang ikalawang circuit ay patatakbuhin na may full PEC mitigation at nangangailangan ng parehong annotation na `Twirl` at `InjectNoise`.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Learn the noise {#learn-the-noise}"
msgstr "Matutunan ang noise {#learn-the-noise}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To minimize the number of noise learning experiments, identify the unique instructions in the second circuit (the one with boxes annotated with `InjectNoise`). In defining uniqueness, two box instructions are equal if both of the following are true:\n"
"- Their content is equal, up to single-qubit gates.\n"
"- Their `Twirl` annotation is equal (every other annotation is disregarded).\n"
msgstr ""
"Upang mabawasan ang bilang ng mga eksperimento sa noise learning, tukuyin ang mga natatanging tagubilin sa pangalawang circuit (ang isa na may mga box na annotated na may `InjectNoise`). Sa pagdefinisyon ng uniqueness, ang dalawang tagubilin ng box ay pantay kung ang parehong mga sumusunod ay totoo:\n"
"- Ang kanilang nilalaman ay pantay, hanggang sa single-qubit na gate.\n"
"- Ang kanilang `Twirl` annotation ay pantay (bawat iba pang annotation ay hindi pinapansin).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This leads to three unique instructions, namely the odd and even gate boxes, and the final measurement box.\n"
msgstr "Ito ay humahantong sa tatlong natatanging tagubilin, katulad ng odd at even na gate box, at ang panghuling measurement box.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Initialize a `NoiseLearnerV3`, choose the learning parameters by setting its options, and run a noise learning job.\n"
msgstr "I-initialize ang isang `NoiseLearnerV3`, piliin ang mga parameter ng pagkatuto sa pamamagitan ng pagtatakda ng mga opsyon nito, at patakbuhin ang noise learning job.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Convert `result` to the object required by the samplex by using the `result.to_dict` method.\n"
msgstr "I-convert ang `result` sa bagay na kinakailangan ng samplex sa pamamagitan ng paggamit ng pamamaraan ng `result.to_dict`.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Execute the circuits {#execute-the-circuits-1}"
msgstr "Isabuhay ang mga circuit {#execute-the-circuits-1}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`Executor` runs `QuantumProgram` objects. Each `QuantumProgram` can contain several *items*, which are appended to the program. Each item is a task for the program to perform.\n"
msgstr "Ang `Executor` ay nagpapatakbo ng mga bagay na `QuantumProgram`. Ang bawat `QuantumProgram` ay maaaring maglaman ng ilang mga *item*, na idinaragdag sa programa. Ang bawat item ay isang gawain na isasagawa ng programa.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Initialize an empty program, requesting `1000` shots for each configuration of each item.\n"
msgstr "Mag-initialize ng walang laman na programa, humihiling ng `1000` shots para sa bawat configuration ng bawat item.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, build the template circuit and samplex for `mirror_circuit_twirl` and append them to the program. Also request `900` randomizations from the samplex. This means that the samplex will generate `900` sets of parameters, and each set will be executed `1000` times (the number of shots) in the QPU.\n"
msgstr "Susunod, i-build ang template circuit at samplex para sa `mirror_circuit_twirl` at i-append ang mga ito sa programa. Humiling din ng `900` randomization mula sa samplex. Nangangahulugan ito na ang samplex ay bumubuo ng `900` na set ng mga parameter, at ang bawat set ay isasagawa ng `1000` beses (ang bilang ng mga shot) sa QPU.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This is the program's first task (result 0).\n"
msgstr "Ito ang unang gawain ng programa (resulta 0).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Similarly, append the template circuit and samplex built for `mirror_circuit_pec`, requesting `900` randomizations.  This is the program's second task (result 1).\n"
msgstr "Katulad nito, i-append ang template circuit at samplex na binuo para sa `mirror_circuit_pec`, humihiling ng `900` randomization. Ito ang pangalawang gawain ng programa (resulta 1).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Import `Executor` and submit a job.\n"
msgstr "I-import ang `Executor` at mag-submit ng job.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Analyze results {#analyze-results}"
msgstr "Suriin ang mga resulta {#analyze-results}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Finally, post-process the results to estimate the expectation values of single-qubit Pauli-Z operators acting on each of the ten active qubits (expected value: `1.0`).\n"
msgstr "Sa wakas, i-post-process ang mga resulta upang matantya ang mga expectation value ng mga single-qubit Pauli-Z operator na kumikilos sa bawat isa sa sampung aktibong qubit (inaasahang halaga: `1.0`).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Mga susunod na hakbang {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
